      "originalText": "- POST /deployments -> Create new deployment\n- PATCH /deployments/:depid -> Make changes to the status of the deployment (e.g stopping the app) \n- GET /deployments\n- GET /deployments/:deppid\n- GET /deployments/latest -> Get the current application deployment, response includes exposed interface, status, \nmetadata, etc",
